msgstr "eov 1.0 より前のアノテーション"

#: src/core.rs:592
msgid ""
"The annotations plugin of eov before 1.0 left a database at {}. Bring its "
"annotations into the current database? The old file is not changed. You can "
"also do this later in the Data tab of the annotations panel."
msgstr ""
"eov 1.0 より前のアノテーションプラグインが作成したデータベースが {} にありま"
"す。そのアノテーションを現在のデータベースに取り込みますか？古いファイルは変"
"更されません。この操作は、後でアノテーションパネルの「データ」タブから行うこ"
"ともできます。"

#: src/core.rs:597
msgid "Bring them in"
msgstr "取り込む"

#: src/core.rs:598
msgid "Not now"
msgstr "今はしない"

#. Translators: the plugin could not ask whether to bring in the annotations made
#. with eov before 1.0 (the title of that question is "Annotations from eov before 1.0").
#: src/core.rs:612
msgid "Could not offer the annotations from eov before 1.0"
msgstr "eov 1.0 より前のアノテーションの取り込みを提案できませんでした"

#: src/core.rs:657 src/sidebar.rs:457
msgid "Could not load this slide's annotations: {}"
msgstr "このスライドのアノテーションを読み込めませんでした：{}"

#. Translators: a second read is an independent annotation of the slide by another person
#. (as in a reader study), not a clinical second opinion. Data, Second reader and Blinded
#. copy are the tab, section and button of the annotations panel: use their translations.
#: src/core.rs:670
msgid ""
"{opened} has the same content as {annotated}, so it shows and edits the same "
"annotations. For an independent second read, use Data → Second reader → "
"Blinded copy."
msgstr ""
"{opened} は {annotated} と内容が同じため、同じアノテーションを表示・編集しま"
"す。独立した第 2 の評価を行うには、「データ」→「第 2 評価者」→「盲検用コ"
"ピー」を使用してください。"

#: src/core.rs:721 src/core.rs:1019 src/core.rs:1156
msgid "the database is not open"
msgstr "データベースが開かれていません"

#: src/core.rs:809
msgid "{n} annotation of {file} could not be read and was skipped."
msgid_plural "{n} annotations of {file} could not be read and were skipped."
msgstr[0] ""
"{file} の {n} 個のアノテーションを読み取れなかったため、スキップしました。"

